t: Model comparison","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_010_s1","report_id":"v3feat_010","text":"In this report we compare several models on standard benchmarks.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_010_s2","report_id":"v3feat_010","text":"The learning rate was set to 0.01 with the Adam optimizer.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_010_s3","report_id":"v3feat_010","text":"The dataset was split into 80 percent training data and the rest for testing.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_010_s4","report_id":"v3feat_010","text":"Figure 1 shows the results of this experiment.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_010_s5","report_id":"v3feat_010","text":"ViT-S achieves 58.6% validation accuracy on CIFAR-10, while ResNet-18 obtains 81.4% validation accuracy on MNIST.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1a","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_010_s6","report_id":"v3feat_010","text":"As shown in Figure 1(b), on SST-2, Ours obtains a F1 score of between 79% and 86%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1a","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_010_s7","report_id":"v3feat_010","text":"Ours scores 25.7 points higher on SST-2 than on MNIST (Figure 1(b)).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1a","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_010_s8","report_id":"v3feat_010","text":"Ours achieves 54.0% F1 score on MNIST (Figure 1(b)).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1a","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_010_s9","report_id":"v3feat_010","text":"Figure 2 shows the results of this experiment.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1a","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_010_s10","report_id":"v3feat_010","text":"EfficientNet achieves between 93% and 99% F1 score on AG News.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_010_s11","report_id":"v3feat_010","text":"EffNet scores 0.9 points higher on AG News than on IMDB (Figure 2).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_010_s12","report_id":"v3feat_010","text":"Figure 3 shows the results of this experiment.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_010_s13","report_id":"v3feat_010","text":"VGG16 reaches 105.7% validation accuracy on IMDB.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_010_s14","report_id":"v3feat_010","text":"VGG-16 achieves 60.3% validation accuracy on AG News.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_010_s15","report_id":"v3feat_010","text":"VGG16 achieves about 60% validation accuracy on AG News (Figure 3).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_010_s16","report_id":"v3feat_010","text":"Overall, the results are in line with what we expected from the literature.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3","figure_id":null}]}